.SH "نام (NAME)"
pto_merge \- Merges two or more Hugin project files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBpto_merge\fR [options] \fIinput1.pto\fR \fIinput2.pto\fR [...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBpto_merge\fR takes a list of .pto projects and joins them together into a single .pto project.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output=file.pto\fR" 4
.IX Item "-o, --output=file.pto"
Output Hugin PTO file. Default: <filename>_merge.pto
